<title>UK: FII makes yr loss, passes div, sets rights.</title>
<headline>FII makes yr loss, passes div, sets rights.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to May 31 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (p, post charges)  83.6 loss	    vs 3.0 earnings</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.0		    vs 14.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     12.6 loss	    vs 0.6 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   76.8		   vs 69.9</p>
<p>NOTE - UK footwear group FII Plc is proposing to raise 7.3 million stg via a 1-for-2 rights issue at 105p to cut debt and complete a reorganisation. Exceptional charges for closures, reorganisation and net assets adjustments were 10.6 million stg.</p>
</text>
